# Waking Dreams (windurst 93): the pact bit for a char with SMN unlocked. player:hasJob(SMN) reads the unlocked jobs,
# not the main job, and a fresh char has only the six basic jobs, so the char first completes I Can Hear a Rainbow
# (Lua, set up by GM: accepted with Prog 1 and a Carbuncle's Ruby; the ruby to the qm3 in La Theine Plateau plays its
# 124, whose finish unlocks SMN). Waking Dreams accepted (GM) with the whisper (GM): 920 with mask 0 (SMN unlocked, no
# pact, no item); option 6: the Diabolos pact (silent) and DIABOLOS_UNLOCKED, completed (fame +60, the whisper taken,
# the date, mustZone). The repeat (a zone change, a day on, the whisper again): 920 with mask 32 (SMN unlocked, the pact
# known: the hasSpell side); option 2: Diabolos's Earring.
lists WindurstWaters/Kerutoto/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/920
char zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-178.2,8.845,254.327
quest Windurst.ICanHearARainbow accepted
charvar Quest[2][75]Prog 1
item CarbunclesRuby
quest Windurst.FoodForThought completed
quest Windurst.WakingDreams accepted
keyitem WhisperOfDreams
login
trade qm3 CarbunclesRuby x1             # I Can Hear a Rainbow, Prog 1: its 124
finish                                  # completed: SMN unlocked, Carbuncle
warp 13.0,-4.71,-155.9 WindurstWaters
trigger Kerutoto                        # accepted, the whisper: 920 (pole, earring, ring, torque, 0, 0, 0, mask 0)
finish option=6                         # the Diabolos pact (silent), DIABOLOS_UNLOCKED; completed; the whisper taken; the date; mustZone
warp 22.0,-4.25,-155.6 WindurstWoods
warp 13.0,-4.71,-155.9 WindurstWaters   # the mustZone cleared
wait jst=1                              # past the lockout
keyitem WhisperOfDreams
trigger Kerutoto                        # 920 (..., 0, 0, 1, mask 32: SMN unlocked, the pact known)
finish option=2                         # Diabolos's Earring; the whisper taken; the date
